ion="float"><label>Table 4</label><caption><p>Comparison of Crohn's disease and Intestinal Tuberculosis with Granuloma</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="kjim-22-1-i004"/><table-wrap-foot><fn><p>S.D., Standard deviation</p><p><sup>1</sup>Mann-Whitney test, Fisher's exact test and Student <italic>t</italic>-test</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="T5" position="float"><label>Table 5</label><caption><p>The Optimal Cut off Value for Immunoreactive Scoring (IRS) in the Differerential Diagnosis between Crohn's Disease and Intestinal Tuberculosis.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="kjim-22-1-i005"/><table-wrap-foot><fn><p>IRS, Immunoreactive scoring</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>